      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Learn more</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">At Stryker, we make products that clinicians use on patients across the continuum of care. Our Sage 2% Chlorhexidine Gluconate Cloths are clinically proven to address bacteria on the skin prior to surgery and do not contain benzalkonium chloride (BZK or BAC).<sup>4</sup> Learn more about our innovative solutions today!</span></p>\n",
